<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Hiss! -->
  <WNA_Hiss>哈！</WNA_Hiss>
  <!-- EN: Our people is enthralled by Permaconst Command! -->
  <WNA_Message_ColonistTurned>一名殖民者被恒固指令操纵了！</WNA_Message_ColonistTurned>
  <!-- EN: We are hostile with Whelingnorther Alliance -->
  <WNA_LordHostility>我们与威灵诺德联合会的关系已破裂</WNA_LordHostility>
  <!-- EN: We are not hostile with Whelingnorther Alliance -->
  <WNA_LordNeutralized>我们与威灵诺德联合会的关系已回暖</WNA_LordNeutralized>
  <!-- EN: Phantom Signal -->
  <WNA_Letter_Permaconst>幽灵信号</WNA_Letter_Permaconst>
  <!-- EN: A series of mysterious phantom signals emanated from deep space, echoing across the planet via hidden relay stations scattered throughout this rimworld. \n\nWhelingnorther Alliance's Permaconst Command has initiated another self-maintenance cycle, and its thralls will once again begin their hunt. Direct confrontation is never a good idea; entrusting the enemy to reliable turret defenses is the best course of action. -->
  <WNA_Letter_Permaconst_Desc>一系列神秘的幽灵信号从宇宙深空而来，经由散落在星球各处的隐秘中继站，在星球的各个角落回荡。\n\n威灵会的恒固指令开启了它的又一个自我维护循环，它所操控的傀儡们将再次开始它们的游猎。直接与其交锋绝不是好主意，将敌人交与可靠的炮塔防线处理才是上策。</WNA_Letter_Permaconst_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Hunting Cluster -->
  <WNA_PermaconstRaidSmall>游猎集群</WNA_PermaconstRaidSmall>
  <!-- EN: The ongoing battle here has attracted a nearby enthralled unit swarm on hunting mission, they will attack immediately! -->
  <WNA_PermaconstRaidSmall_Desc>这里正在发生的混战引来了附近的一个处于游猎状态的役使单位集群，它们将立刻开始进攻！</WNA_PermaconstRaidSmall_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Our beliefs are fundamentally opposed to theirs -->
  <WNA_GiftBlockedIdeoConflict>理念根本对立</WNA_GiftBlockedIdeoConflict>
  <!-- EN: Whelingnorther Holyorder -->
  <WNA_IdeoName>威灵圣教序</WNA_IdeoName>
  <!-- EN: Revealed to sunlight -->
  <WNA_InitialSpawn_Label>重见天日</WNA_InitialSpawn_Label>
  <!-- EN: Whelingnorther Alliance settlements appeared. -->
  <WNA_InitialSpawn_Desc>威灵诺德联合会的据点出现了。</WNA_InitialSpawn_Desc>
  <!-- EN: Return from dust -->
  <WNA_Refill_Label>卷土重来</WNA_Refill_Label>
  <!-- EN: Whelingnorther Alliance has rebuilt their lost settlements and got prepared for further actions. -->
  <WNA_Refill_Desc>威灵诺德联合会重建了他们损失的据点，现在他们已经重整旗鼓。</WNA_Refill_Desc>
</LanguageData>